{"availability":"available","full":"Justinjchen-Cornell/Deep-Risk-OPP","name":"Deep-Risk-OPP","description":"每天08:00自动更新的金油比宏观预警系统：一个数字告诉你油什么时候便宜。公开证伪条款+20年诚实回测+双语LIVE仪表盘 | One number that tells you when oil is historically cheap. Daily auto-updated GOR macro signal, falsifiable and auditable.","category":"Finance","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-26T12:27:45Z","updated":"2026-10-08T04:13:19Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://justinjchen-cornell.github.io/Deep-Risk-OPP/","topics":["automation","bilingual","commodities","data-pipeline","github-pages","gold-oil-ratio","gor","investment-research","macro","open-source","quantitative-finance","risk-management"],"demo":"https://justinjchen-cornell.github.io/Deep-Risk-OPP/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.925Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.925Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.925Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:26:08.925Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One number that tells you when oil is historically cheap. GOR = Gold ÷ Oil. When it crosses 45, history says oil rallies 54-167% within 12-24 months. Honesty audit update (Sep 2026): we stress-audited this claim against 56 years of data. The direction survives; the evidence is thinner than it sounds — only 2–3 independent macro episodes (the \"history\" is mostly 2020 and today), and the strongest sample months overlap each other. Verdict: GOR ≥ 45 is a tail marker, not a probability law — and panic is the necessary condition (history: 82.6% mean-reversion when the market was in fear vs 47.8%…","🌐 Live Site | 🇨🇳 中文版 | 🌐 English | 📡 Dashboard | 📈 Track Record","Deep-Risk-OPP turns one ratio into a daily macro decision. It watches the Gold/Oil Ratio (GOR) as a seismograph for systemic stress, maps global capital flows as fault-line scans, and runs 11 decision frameworks + 6 legendary-investor mindsets through a priority engine — producing a single allocation card every day, published automatically to a public website."],"features":["The claim: GOR ≥ 45 has never failed to precede oil gains of 54-167% over the following 12-24 months (1998, 2008, 2016, 2020). (Audited Sep 2026: direction holds; independent episodes ≈ 2–3 — see the honesty audit note…","The state (Aug 2026): GOR(WTI) = 53.8 — its 13th consecutive month above 45, the longest stretch in recorded history. Gold $4,454/oz, WTI $82.75.","The output: a live bilingual website updated daily by GitHub Actions. Zero black-box AI. Every threshold is in config.py."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Justinjchen-Cornell/Deep-Risk-OPP/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"48b089a2fe58b91f2263a29708d7ba580e102426bb7a30d1f62eed9d8081d842","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:09.074Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:09.074Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"One number that tells you when oil is historically cheap. GOR = Gold ÷ Oil. When it crosses 45, history says oil rallies 54-167% within 12-24 months. Honesty audit update (Sep 2026): we stress-audited this claim against 56 years of data. The direction survives; the evidence is thinner than it sounds — only 2–3 independent macro episodes (the \"history\" is mostly 2020 and today), and the strongest sample months overlap each other. Verdict: GOR ≥ 45 is a tail marker, not a probability law — and panic is the necessary condition (history: 82.6% mean-reversion when the market was in fear vs 47.8%…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Justinjchen-Cornell/Deep-Risk-OPP/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The daily pipeline needs two free API keys.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Justinjchen-Cornell/Deep-Risk-OPP/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"48b089a2fe58b91f2263a29708d7ba580e102426bb7a30d1f62eed9d8081d842","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Justinjchen-Cornell/Deep-Risk-OPP/blob/main/README.md",